/* Help (SpiderBoard HelpContent). Numbers and shortcuts in the keys come from the game's rules. */
"Rules" = "Rules";
"The goal" = "The goal";
"Build eight complete runs, King down to Ace in a single suit. Each finished run leaves the table on its own. When all eight are done, you win." = "Build eight complete runs, King down to Ace in a single suit. Each finished run leaves the table on its own. When all eight are done, you win.";
"The layout" = "The layout";
"Two packs (104 cards) are dealt into 10 columns: the first four get 6 cards, the other six get 5. Only the top card of each column is face up. The other 50 cards wait in the stock at the bottom right, enough for 5 more deals." = "Two packs (104 cards) are dealt into 10 columns: the first four get 6 cards, the other six get 5. Only the top card of each column is face up. The other 50 cards wait in the stock at the bottom right, enough for 5 more deals.";
"Moving cards" = "Moving cards";
"Drag a face-up card onto a card exactly one rank higher, in any suit: a 7 goes on any 8." = "Drag a face-up card onto a card exactly one rank higher, in any suit: a 7 goes on any 8.";
"You can move several cards at once only if they are in order and all the same suit, such as 9♥ 8♥ 7♥." = "You can move several cards at once only if they are in order and all the same suit, such as 9♥ 8♥ 7♥.";
"When a move uncovers a face-down card, it turns over by itself." = "When a move uncovers a face-down card, it turns over by itself.";
"Double-click a card to send it (with the cards on top of it) to the best place." = "Double-click a card to send it (with the cards on top of it) to the best place.";
"Empty columns" = "Empty columns";
"Any card, or any run in one suit, can go into an empty column. Empty columns are your best tool for sorting cards, so use them carefully." = "Any card, or any run in one suit, can go into an empty column. Empty columns are your best tool for sorting cards, so use them carefully.";
"Dealing" = "Dealing";
"Click the stock, or choose Game ▸ Deal Next Row, to put one new card face up on every column. You can't deal while a column is empty: fill it first. (The one exception is near the end, when there are fewer than 10 cards on the table.)" = "Click the stock, or choose Game ▸ Deal Next Row, to put one new card face up on every column. You can't deal while a column is empty: fill it first. (The one exception is near the end, when there are fewer than 10 cards on the table.)";
"Completing suits" = "Completing suits";
"As soon as a column ends with King to Ace in one suit, those 13 cards fly to the bottom left and the card under them turns face up." = "As soon as a column ends with King to Ace in one suit, those 13 cards fly to the bottom left and the card under them turns face up.";
"One Suit: every card is a spade. The gentlest start." = "One Suit: every card is a spade. The gentlest start.";
"Two Suits: spades and hearts. You'll need to keep the suits apart." = "Two Suits: spades and hearts. You'll need to keep the suits apart.";
"Four Suits: all four suits. A real challenge; many deals take several tries." = "Four Suits: all four suits. A real challenge; many deals take several tries.";
"Change it from Game ▸ Difficulty. A new game starts at the chosen level." = "Change it from Game ▸ Difficulty. A new game starts at the chosen level.";
"Scoring" = "Scoring";
"Every game starts at 500 points." = "Every game starts at 500 points.";
